00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.310
or in five minutes
or in 20 minutes?

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:36.143
And so it kind of
controls-- the bucket span

00:15:36.143 --> 00:15:38.155
controls the granularity
of the analysis.

00:15:38.155 --> 00:15:39.240
YURI GRINSHTEYN: Got it.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:40.120
OK, that makes sense.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.661
CHRISTOPHER WURM:
Yeah, so here we're

00:15:41.661 --> 00:15:44.140
looking at 15-minutes
bucket spans.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:47.980
Now here we can see
the data aggregators.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:50.230
And we can already visually
see that there is probably

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:54.310
some kind of anomaly here in
the latter half of the data.

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:56.320
Now, if we had a dashboard
