00:16:28.038 --> 00:16:30.290
It's just one metric.

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:31.590
It should be relatively quick.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:32.631
YURI GRINSHTEYN: Oh, wow.

00:16:32.631 --> 00:16:34.590
And you actually watch
