00:17:58.228 --> 00:18:00.300
And they're using Elastic.

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:02.830
So they're looking at the
website for different things.

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:04.288
And then we suddenly
had a big drop

00:18:04.288 --> 00:18:06.570
down in our number
of visitors here.

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:08.960
We can see this visually.

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:10.700
But we can also
look into the table

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:13.912
down here, where we can see
