00:18:26.716 --> 00:18:27.840
So it's a very big anomaly.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.090
And that's why we mark it red.

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:32.175
And we give it a
very high score.

00:18:32.175 --> 00:18:33.970
YURI GRINSHTEYN: So
am I going to spoil it

00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:35.920
