00:19:02.519 --> 00:19:04.060
But we rolled it
back fairly quickly.

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:04.852
So it went back up.

00:19:04.852 --> 00:19:06.643
YURI GRINSHTEYN: And
you can actually tell.

00:19:06.643 --> 00:19:09.530
If you look at the data, I
mean, it went right back up.

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:12.700
So whoever was on call that
day was able to react really

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:14.654
