00:19:23.769 --> 00:19:25.810
If you have looked at the
data in any other way--

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.410
and then you can react
to it really quickly.

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:29.260
And that goes back to
a point about speed,

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:30.900
where you want to be fast.

